          "visual": "A static digital screen with a split layout. The background is a clean, off-white flat surface. In the top left, there is a pill-shaped button in orange with text. In the top right, a matching pill-shaped button in light gray. Below these, there is a central list of seven light-gray horizontal bars containing text. The lighting is uniform and artificial, with no shadows or depth. The color palette is minimalist: orange, gray, and white.",
