          "visual": "The camera remains static. The fifth bar in the list transitions from light gray to dark charcoal gray, joining the first and third bars in the left-hand category. Simultaneously, the second and fourth bars shift slightly to the right of the screen, aligning under the gray button on the right. The transition is an instant jump-cut animation.",
